<Base title="Meet Vishruth">
  <section class="about-hero wrap"><div><span class="section-kicker">THE PERSON BEHIND THE NOTES</span><h1>Hi, I’m Vishruth<span class="brand-dot">.</span></h1><p class="large-copy">A technologist by profession.<br />A student by choice.</p><p>I’m a Senior Customer Success Engineer at Dynatrace, based in Bengaluru. I work with engineers to understand complicated systems and make observability useful in the real world.</p><p>Outside that work, I build tools, write about what I’m learning, and make time for people finding their way in technology.</p><a class="button" href={site.mentoring}>Let’s have a conversation ↗</a></div><div class="portrait-frame"><img src="/images/vishruth.jpg" alt="Vishruth Harithsa" width="800" height="800"/><span>VISHRUTH HARITHSA · BENGALURU</span></div></section>
  <section class="about-story wrap"><span class="section-kicker">WHY THIS NOTEBOOK EXISTS</span><div><h2>Learn something.<br /><em>Pass it on.</em></h2><p>I’ve always been drawn to how things work: the request moving through a browser, the signals hiding inside a system, the idea that could become something useful.</p><p>This notebook is a place for those questions. Some notes are technical. Some are about work and life. All of them begin with curiosity.</p><p>My interests stretch from open source and AI to books and astrophysics. I don’t have all the answers. Writing helps me ask better questions.</p></div></section>
